Classification: Existing controls verified + minor clearCookie defect identified.
Current Cookie Attributes Verified: session_token, calendar_session, rf_sid, and new csrf_ctx are all host-only cookies (no Domain attribute), Path=/, HttpOnly=true, SameSite=Lax, and Secure=true in production.
