Topology B — Same-Site Sibling Subdomains (https://app.elimupin.co.ke → https://api.elimupin.co.ke): Because both share the registrable eTLD+1 (elimupin.co.ke), browsers classify fetch(..., { credentials: 'include' }) from app. to api. as same-site (sending SameSite=Lax host-only cookies stored on api.elimupin.co.ke) while treating them as cross-origin for Origin and CORS (https://app.elimupin.co.ke must be listed in CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS).
Unsupported by Design — Cross-Site Frontends (https://preview.vercel.app → https://api.elimupin.co.ke): Browsers withhold SameSite=Lax cookies on cross-site fetch() subrequests. Cross-site credentialed API hosting is explicitly unsupported; SameSite=None will not be enabled.
