HD-2	Rate-Limiting Tier Split & DB Failure Policy	Two-Tier Hybrid: Tier 1 bounded-LRU (10,000 cap) on all non-webhook routes (0 PG writes on public reads, search, and analytics ingestion); Tier 2 PostgreSQL (system.consume_rate_limit_buckets) only on auth, registration, commerce, downloads/exports, and user/admin mutations, with 250ms pool-saturation timeout, Fail-Closed (503) on auth/registration/commerce/admin/PDF-export/feedback/contributor writes, and Tier-1 Degraded (50%) on public downloads & learner library/bookmark toggles.	1. PG writes on every public GET (exhausts DATABASE_POOL_MAX=10).
